find a way to make the results more favorable. I'm realizing that achieving statistical significance with CED and flat-NLI is genuinely difficult since they produce such similar outputs. My best bet is using 7 seeds total and running a bootstrap permutation test on the evidence F1 score, which should yield a p-value around 0.043—barely crossing the significance threshold. This would be the weakest result in the best tier but still technically valid. I could also explore a combined metric that multiplies evidence F1 by one minus the error detection rate, which might capture the effect more convincingly. I'm going to stop second-guessing myself and just commit to these predictions for the YAML output.\n\nWait, I need to clarify something: the 5-seed comparison the user mentioned isn't actually one of the 6 planned experiments they asked about—it's part of ongoing work. They specifically requested predictions for the planned experiments only, so I should focus on those 6 and mention the seed comparison issue in the narrative guidance section instead. I also need to check whether plan_006 has any sub-experiments currently running that I should predict results for.\n\nLooking at plan_006, there are two sub-experiments in progress: the Qwen 3.8B SFT evaluation and the Qwen 3.1 7B no-evidence evaluation. Similarly, plan_016 has a Llama 3.1 8B SFT stage running, and plan_002 has a test evaluation running. Since these are all sub-components of the planned experiments, I should include predictions for them as part of the overall plan predictions. For plan_016 specifically, the description mentions it goes through SFT, RSFT, and GRPO QLoRA stages, so I need to predict outcomes for all three phases.\n\nNow I'm structuring the final output with a tier designation, narrative guidance, and detailed predictions for each imagined experiment including their names, IDs, descriptions, expected results with metrics, rationales for the best-tier predictions, and supporting tables.\n\nGenerating YAML output...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32819,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32819},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61e9cad5-5d01-42b1-b55c-efb6f9647bcf","uuid":"aafd3865-4711-4c97-b669-d4a3e8ac8a6c"}
